WEBVTT

00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:34.940
<b>Practice Makes Squid Perfect?!</b>

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:44.870
Sis, is the yakisoba coming?

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:48.330
Coming right up, Eiko!

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:51.280
I'll take this for you.

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:55.210
I've come to squid-vade this house by the sea!

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:56.220
Huh?

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:05.220
Keep quiet, and nobody squidding gets hurt.

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:08.080
Damn it!

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:09.230
Leave this to me!

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:14.980
I've got to call the police!

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:19.240
I can't let you do that!

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:28.710
So, are you all ready to submit to me?

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:30.430
I submit!

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:32.670
I'll do anything, just spare me!

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:35.000
I see.

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:38.850
Then, my faithful servants!

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:40.420
My first order is...

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:43.320
My first order is...

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:47.520
I got it!

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.660
Bring me an extra big portion 
of shrimp-fried rice-

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:50.580
Hey!

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:51.900
Who do you think you are?

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:54.190
What are you doing?

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.480
Hey, Squiddie.

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:59.950
Invasion club

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:57.910
So what are we supposed to do?

00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:59.950
You're squidpposed to wait!

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:02.870
What are you getting all worked up about?

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:06.080
This isn't going to work if 
you don't take it seriously!

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:09.080
You want to train them to 
prepare for an invasion?

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:12.840
You mean you want us to practice 
kicking you out of here?

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:14.090
No!

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:17.660
There are all sorts 
of invaders out there.

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:21.310
You've got to prepare 
yourself for any squidnario!

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:23.930
I thought you were supposed 
to be the invader?

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:27.060
Invaders other than Squid Girlie?

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:28.920
I wonder what they're like.

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.850
I guess you could theoretically 
call that an invader.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.270
Chizuru, there's a fly 
coming up right behind...

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:39.950
That's my sis for you!

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:40.400
Yeah!

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.860
Don't tell me she's squiddy got 
eyes in the back of her head!

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:46.130
Eiko, look at that!

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:47.000
Oh sick!

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.700
If those start coming in here...

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.500
What did she do?

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:01.220
Careful.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:02.550
It's not safe.

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:07.550
It even worked on that child!

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:09.780
As you can see, my sis is the

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:12.770
only security system this place needs.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:15.310
We can't be so dependent on Chizuru!

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:18.860
What I mean is, we've got to prepare 
for the worst case squidnario!

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:22.250
Isn't that why we left that up to you?

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:26.490
Then let's try it again!

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:29.790
Those idiots.

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:33.000
They think it's just training 
for Eiko and the others,

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.520
but it's actually practice 
for me to see whether or not

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:38.790
I could take this place over 
when Chizuru isn't squidding here.

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:41.300
Remember, I told you last time about...

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:45.200
I've come to squid-vade this house by the sea!

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:48.720
First, I've got to find the 
easiest looking target: Nagisa.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:49.900
If I can't see her, I won't be scared!

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:51.680
If I can't see her, I won't be scared...

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:51.680
That's dangerous!

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:53.820
I've got no choice.

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:55.360
I'm going to have to target the children.

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:58.270
Cool!

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:00.610
I always wanted to try this!

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:02.440
Swing us around more, Squid Girlie!

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:04.630
Next!

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:05.800
Yay!

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:09.040
I've got to subdue the strong first...

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:13.510
This is my chance to show Chizuru 
that she can count on me!

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:14.620
Let's go, Isozaki!

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:17.020
Wow, you're here too?

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:18.020
Hey!

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:21.800
Thank you!

00:05:22.110 --> 00:05:24.470
I ended up lending a tentacle?!

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:26.510
Who else needs to be dealt with?

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:27.970
Squiddie!

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.890
Squiddie!

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.360
Why do you hurt so good?

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:42.290
Why is she getting tougher?

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.560
I've had enough!

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:46.680
I'm going to squidding wrap up all of you!

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.560
Stupid humans.

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:55.200
Now you see what I'm like 
when I stop playing around.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:06:00.300
This is just training... right?

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:04.250
What would you do if I had 
pretended that this is training

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:07.190
but was actually squidpletely serious?

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.430
You see?

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:12.470
You're sitting ducks without Chizuru around.

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:15.240
Excuse us...

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:15.770
Huh?

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:18.420
But can you please let us go?

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:20.260
Oh gross!

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:22.780
You're all sweaty and sticking to me!

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:24.210
Wait!

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:28.010
If you squeeze us any tighter, 
you'll make me squeeze my

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:31.280
finger on the trigger of 
this Brainplosion Gun!

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:32.570
I squidrrender!

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:38.830
Even without Chizuru around, their defensive 
measures are as solid as an oyster's shell.

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:42.690
Don't you need to train for yourself, too?

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:48.630
You have to consider the scenario 
where all of us attack you.

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:13.320
I'm sorry, but could you 
please hide me in here?

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:15.160
Sure.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:25.730
I don't stand a squid of a chance!

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:26.800
Don't worry!

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:28.210
This is just training.

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:29.970
Training!

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:32.010
It's just training!

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:37.700
I don't squidding believe you!!

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:41.350
I can't believe this!

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:44.020
You erased my saved game again!

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:46.400
You only have one save slot on this game!

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:48.860
You saw the ending the other day.

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:52.070
Why are you so upset about erasing 
a game you already finished?

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:55.070
Because that wasn't the ending!

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:57.460
I was just getting up to the last boss!

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:01.140
Just start over!

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:02.630
How can you just say that?

00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:06.120
You're doing this on purpose, aren't you?

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:08.300
I'm not that kind of sea scum!

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:11.020
Don't you think you're being 
too squidding petty?

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:20.010
What you did is basically this!

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:22.850
What are you doing?! 
That's my shrimp collection!

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:24.590
Well, you can have plenty
 of fun collecting them

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:25.840
again from the beginning!

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:28.000
There's a difference between 
doing something on accident,

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:29.400
and doing it on purpose!

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.020
If you did something wrong,

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:32.820
it doesn't matter if it was on purpose or not!

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:35.980
What is the racket about?

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:39.280
Eiko's getting all worked 
up again about squidding nothing.

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:42.750
Fine.

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:44.830
I get it.

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.580
I'm never speaking to you again!

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:51.910
Be my squiddy guest!

00:08:57.900 --> 00:09:01.030
They say that "the closer you get,
 the more you fight," but...

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:01.950
Yeah.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:06.150
But I'm sure they'll be back 
to normal by tomorrow.

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:11.150
<b>Ink That A Festival?!</b>

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:13.250
Beers, please!

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:14.110
Yes, sir!

00:09:14.480 --> 00:09:16.980
Eiko, it's pretty busy, 
so can you move faster?

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.420
Got it.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.730
They're not back to normal!

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:28.670
Isn't this the first time it's gone so long?

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:30.880
They're both so stubborn.

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:34.380
I just got a good idea!

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:36.220
Here you go.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:39.230
Can you wash the front deck...

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:40.760
with Squid Girl?

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:43.430
What do you mean, "with" her?

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:44.930
You saw what happened yesterday.

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:48.370
No, you can't let your private 
life affect your work life.

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:50.980
Then you'll need to ask her,

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:53.850
because I'm not talking to her.

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:55.440
Geez.

00:09:56.380 --> 00:10:00.820
Squid Girl, will you go 
wash the deck with Eiko?

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:04.330
Well, if you order me to,
 I guess I have to.

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:07.020
What's that, "If you order me to"?

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:15.510
Whoops.

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:17.780
My tentacle slipped.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:19.100
What the hell are you doing?

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:21.120
Hey, my tentacle just slipped.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:24.180
I'm not the one who dumped 
the mop on your head.

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:27.280
You really...

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:28.890
Forget it.

00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:32.550
I'm wasting my breath with you.

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:36.070
Oh, man.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:40.330
That looks like a pain.

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:43.220
Just tell me if there's 
anything I can do to help.

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:46.300
Your face doesn't match 
what you're saying at all.

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:47.750
Oh no, really?

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.290
Of course it doesn't!

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:52.180
The unsurmountable obstacle named 
Eiko that was always in the way

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:56.170
of getting closer to Squiddie 
has finally been vanquished!

00:10:58.030 --> 00:10:59.580
Squiddie!

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:02.360
Oh.

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:04.680
Just because she doesn't like Eiko anymore,

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:07.560
doesn't necessarily mean that she likes me.

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:09.660
I'm going to take a squiddle break.

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:11.020
Take care!

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:16.060
No, it's even worse... If Eiko and 
Squiddie aren't together,

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:18.690
she won't even give me a look!

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:22.540
Eiko, you've got to make up with Squiddie!

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:24.660
Why do you care so much?

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:30.910
Anyway, I haven't even thought 
about making up with her.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.210
Everyone's worried about you.

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:36.820
Well, I'm squidding fine.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:39.170
But you actually want to make 
up with her, don't you?

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:40.650
Not even a squiddle bit.

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:44.900
I was actually getting sick 
of her nagging all the time.

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:47.470
I'm relieved to be rid of that barnacle.

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:49.140
Do you really mean that?

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:50.840
Of course!

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:54.150
Sorry I'm late!

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:57.520
I'm sorry!

00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:58.280
Are you hurt?

00:11:58.280 --> 00:11:59.580
I'm fine.

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:00.740
Are you okay?

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.080
I'm fine, too.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:04.160
First we should clean it up...

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:07.490
I guess there are people who aren't 
content with being useless.

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:09.320
They've also got to be in the way.

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:12.080
It's not like I squidding
 asked to work here.

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:14.500
It's not like we asked 
you to stay either.

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:16.500
How can you even say that

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:18.430
after working me to death for so long?!

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:20.760
If you don't like it, 
you can just go back to the sea!

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:23.110
What did you say?!

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:25.260
I said, go back to the sea!

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:34.940
I'm closing the restaurant early today.

00:12:39.180 --> 00:12:40.480
I'd like one order, please.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:41.110
Yes, sir!

00:12:41.430 --> 00:12:43.140
What's with the yukata?

00:12:43.140 --> 00:12:45.200
You look great, Eiko.

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:47.570
Not me. Her.

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:50.460
Aren't those my yukata and my sandals?

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:51.960
Why does she get to...

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:54.150
Come on, they don't even fit you anymore.

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:55.290
That's still...

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:59.420
I'm only wearing these because 
Chizuru squidding asked me to.

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:12.270
Oh, there they are!

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:14.100
Sorry to have kept you waiting.

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:15.860
Good evening.

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:19.230
Squiddie, you look so cute in that yukata!

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:22.110
Stay the squid away from me!

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:23.650
Squiddie!

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:24.810
Kiyomi!

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:25.610
You all came.

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:28.590
Your yukata is really cute.

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:29.870
You really think so?

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:30.510
Yeah!

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:32.020
It looks so pretty on you!

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:35.560
Who do they think they are?

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:37.140
Let's go, Sanae.

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:40.220
Isn't Squiddie coming along?

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:43.090
Why do I have to drag her 
around with me everywhere?

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:47.850
Kiyomi, we and the Invasion Club 
are going to squidjoy ourselves!

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:53.390
Squid Girlie... Eiko?

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:55.890
What are we going to do?

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.950
There's not much we can do.

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:01.610
Let's just try to enjoy ourselves.

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:09.270
Kiyomi, what the squid is that?

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:11.000
It's cotton candy.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.240
It's really good!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:13.540
You want to have some?

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:20.290
It's so sweet, yet it melts away on your tongue!

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:24.890
Even the sweetness melts away so quickly,

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:27.380
it leaves only the memory of itself...

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:29.950
It seems so futile.

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:33.100
It's basically like 
relationships with people.

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:38.700
I don't think it's like that at all, right?

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:39.510
Right!

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:41.160
You think so?

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:44.970
What was that?

00:14:44.970 --> 00:14:47.110
It's all sticky and clinging to my face!

00:14:48.090 --> 00:14:52.870
Getting stuck over a trivial 
thing and ruining everything...

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:56.190
Yup, just like relationships with people.

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:01.420
Eiko, is this really okay?

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:02.690
What are you talking about?

00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:05.240
If you would rather hang out 
with Squid Girl, just go back.

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:07.130
That's not what I mean.

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.930
Well, maybe a little bit... Anyway...

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:13.000
I don't understand what's 
so great about her.

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:14.810
She has so many good qualities!

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:16.330
Like what?!

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:19.530
Well, she's really cute, 
and she's very cute...

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:20.950
and did I mention she was cute?

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:22.640
I don't see it at all!

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:26.770
I did it!

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:28.320
Good, now let's get that one next.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:29.740
I see how it is.

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.580
They chase the fish around 
with little nets and then

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:35.280
they lock them in an 
even tinier plastic bag.

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:39.120
Humans sure are cruel.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.250
Squiddie...

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.170
You're wrong! It's the other way around!

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:46.420
We are saving them from this rectangular 
prison that confines them!

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:50.950
Is that what's happening?

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:52.470
Then just you wait!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:55.910
I'll get you out of your jail,
comrades of the water!

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:00.020
Let me try again!

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:07.230
Maybe... you should let that be...

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:08.590
Wait!

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:10.650
Give me one more squiddle chance!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:17.280
Now I'm serious!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.580
It looks like I saved most of 'em!

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:29.590
Good for you, Squiddie!

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.830
I want to get a candy apple.

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:32.510
Me too!

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:36.890
But you don't have a home 
I can take you back to.

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:39.790
<b>Candy Apples</b>

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:48.900
Now you can live free.

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:54.390
Kiyomi?

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:56.110
Everyone?

00:16:57.190 --> 00:16:58.870
Squid Girl is lost?

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:01.190
Yes! I'm so sorry!

00:17:01.190 --> 00:17:02.960
We've got to find her!

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:04.810
Where can she be?

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:06.010
I'm worried.

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:07.630
She's not a child.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:08.710
I think she's fine.

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:10.380
Let's just leave her.

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:13.730
It's her fault for always wandering around.

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:15.240
Serves her right, I say.

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:16.430
Serves her right.

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:21.660
Where did they go?

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:24.890
I've got no idea!

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:27.290
Watch where you're going!

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:28.460
I'm sorry!

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:30.820
Over there, Papa!

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:33.200
All right, I got it.

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:40.490
She's not coming.

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:42.980
Maybe she really is off crying somewhere.

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:46.560
Why don't we split up and look for her?

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:47.250
Let's do it!

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:51.520
Okay. We'll search the places 
we hadn't gone to yet.

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:52.820
I'm going, too!

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:54.040
Me, too!

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:56.500
Let's look over here!

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:05.650
It's raining.

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:08.520
Geez...

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.730
<b>Octopus Balls</b>

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:10.730
It's an evening shower!

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:17.280
Where's my sandal?

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:20.780
Wait!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.690
Squiddie!

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:26.160
Senior Squid?!

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:28.350
Chizuru, did you find her?

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:29.380
We haven't found her.

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:30.810
Damn it!

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:32.130
What the...

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:41.050
This is...

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:43.060
Eiko

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:50.840
Squid Girl!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.580
This can't be happening!

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:55.030
I mean, there's no way she could drown!

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:57.440
Hey, Squid Girl!

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:04.860
It's just a handkerchief.

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:10.070
What am I doing?

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:13.340
The gravest mistakes are made 
when something matters.

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:28.810
Misjudgement. Misunderstanding. Discord.

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:31.760
All things are best to 
resolve right away, but...

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:33.980
Who... are you?

00:19:36.350 --> 00:19:38.950
Please offer her your hand.

00:19:44.230 --> 00:19:46.520
Eiko's sandals and yukata are ruined.

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:51.270
I can't go back like this!

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:58.520
Eiko!

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:09.220
The yukata and sandals you treasured...

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:14.270
You silly. Did you think 
I'd get mad about that?

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:17.280
But... but...

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:33.460
Eiko!

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:39.920
Eiko!

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:44.090
Eiko!

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:51.680
We've looked for her everywhere.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:52.890
Damn it.

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.830
Where could she possibly have gone?

00:20:55.910 --> 00:20:56.890
Look!

00:20:57.650 --> 00:20:58.790
Squiddie!

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:00.170
Squid Girlie!

00:21:01.850 --> 00:21:03.360
Squiddie!

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:05.840
I was so worried about you!

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:06.920
Squid Girlie!

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:07.780
Senior Squid!

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:09.510
We're so glad you're okay!

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:11.820
Damn, you had us running around like crazy!

00:21:11.820 --> 00:21:13.520
Everyone's changed.

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:14.360
Huh?

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:18.460
Doesn't it feel like Squid Girl is 
now at the center of our lives?

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:24.490
I think we may have been 
invaded a long time ago.

00:21:31.910 --> 00:21:33.930
Eiko, what are they doing?

00:21:34.220 --> 00:21:35.790
That's the Obon dance.

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:38.260
Today, everybody enjoys themselves 
by dancing together.

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:43.800
Then let's get out there and 
dance our tentacles off!

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:45.030
H-Hey...

00:23:19.580 --> 00:23:20.790
I can't believe this!

00:23:20.790 --> 00:23:23.110
You ran into me on purpose, didn't you?!

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:25.340
Is this how you treat food?

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:27.720
I'm telling you, my tentacles slipped!

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:29.850
You're getting worked up over nothing!

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:33.570
I'm never speaking to you again!

00:23:33.570 --> 00:23:35.860
Be my squidding guest!
